{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e18-scene-11",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "老搭档回归稳住军心  (Old Partners Return to Steady the Crew)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After a sleepless night in the office, Bu Xiaogu is overjoyed when Kaiwen and Xingzi return to Xingtian to stand beside her and calm rumors among the floor crew. Listen to their Mandarin reunion first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我没节操地回来了，欢迎吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "激动，太激动了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大加班刚睡醒，不怕挨骂就接着喊啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我是来陪你唱空城计的，有什么活儿？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一公一私两件事，公事是昨晚爆发的虚假广告问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "除了按照常规的法律程序处理以外，还要挽回声誉损失。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "保住闻娱论这档精品评论节目的声誉，对星天最重要。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "对，没错，闻老师好不容易才把闻娱论打造成今天这个地步。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我昨晚熬夜做了一份怎么处理这件事的方案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "要不然我去办吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "来来来，这件事交给我吧，我来！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "跟你抢真没劲啊。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我没节操地回来了，欢迎吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have come shamelessly back—am I welcome?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "激动，太激动了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am thrilled, truly thrilled!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大加班刚睡醒，不怕挨骂就接着喊啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The boss just woke up after working overtime—keep shouting if you want a scolding.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我是来陪你唱空城计的，有什么活儿？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I came back to help you stage this empty fort—what work have you got?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一公一私两件事，公事是昨晚爆发的虚假广告问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Two matters, one official and one personal; the official one is last night's false ad scandal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "除了按照常规的法律程序处理以外，还要挽回声誉损失。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Beyond following standard legal procedures, we must repair the damage to our reputation.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "保住闻娱论这档精品评论节目的声誉，对星天最重要。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Protecting the reputation of Wen Simo's flagship commentary show matters most to Xingtian.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "对，没错，闻老师好不容易才把闻娱论打造成今天这个地步。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right, Mr Wen worked so hard to build that commentary show to where it stands today.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我昨晚熬夜做了一份怎么处理这件事的方案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I stayed up all night drafting a proposal on how to handle this crisis.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "要不然我去办吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How about I go take care of it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "来来来，这件事交给我吧，我来！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here, hand this job over to me, I will take it!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "跟你抢真没劲啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fighting you for assignments is no fun at all.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我没节操地回来了，欢迎吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
