    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "来来来，这件事交给我吧，我来！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "跟你抢真没劲啊。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With the floor crew reassured that Chun Yuqiao is merely resting after overtime, Xingzi and Kaiwen jump straight into executing Xiaogu's overnight crisis plan. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
